  create · dry run, nothing applied
  Branches      feat/a, feat/b
  From          main
  Env           example
  Fast-forward  main
  Remember      env_from

  ! The "parent" env strategy needs the source branch checked out to copy its .env; without a worktree it comes from main.

  fingerprint  0123456789abcdef01234567
  → wtm create feat/a feat/b --env-from example --remember env_from --expect-fingerprint 0123456789abcdef01234567   apply this plan
